  - `create_task` (POST): requires auth via `Depends(require_api_key)`, validates `project_id` exists (404), auto-generates ID as `max(id)+1`, returns 201 with the created task.
  - `update_task` (PUT): requires auth, partial-updates `title`/`status`/`priority`/`assigned_to`, returns 404 if not found.
  - `delete_task` (DELETE): requires auth, removes task from list, returns 204, 404 if not found.
